<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Player prototype · Invasion Studio</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/player-prototype.css">
  <script type="module" src="/assets/player-prototype.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header><a href="/">← Back to library</a><h1>Video.js v10 prototype</h1></header>
  <p>Try event markers and editable removal ranges. Demo markers are illustrative; detection is not connected yet.</p>
  <label>Clip <select id="clips"><option value="">Select a clip…</option></select></label>
  <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading clips…</p>
  <fieldset id="editor" disabled>
    <video-player><video-skin><video playsinline preload="metadata"></video></video-skin></video-player>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <label>Audio <select id="audio"></select></label>
      <label><input id="skip" type="checkbox" checked> Skip removal ranges during playback</label>
      <button id="fullscreen" type="button">Fullscreen editor</button>
      <output id="time">0.00 / 0.00 s</output>
    </div>
    <div id="timeline" aria-label="Event markers and removal ranges">
      <div id="ranges"></div><div id="markers"></div><div id="playhead"></div>
    </div>
    <label class="scrubber">Seek <input id="seek" type="range" min="0" max="0" step="0.01" value="0"></label>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button id="mark-start" type="button">[ Mark start</button>
      <button id="mark-end" type="button">] Mark end</button>
      <button id="undo" type="button">Undo cuts</button>
      <button id="demo" type="button">Load demo markers + two cuts</button>
    </div>
    <div id="cut-list"></div>
    <div id="event-list" class="toolbar"></div>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button id="save" type="button">Save cuts</button>
      <button id="finalize" type="button">Finalize cuts…</button>
      <span id="draft" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </div>
    <p>Red ranges are removed. Drag their edges or edit the times below. Save shares these cuts with the regular player. Finalization modifies the clip using the existing FFmpeg workflow.</p>
  </fieldset>
</body>
</html>
